@startuml
title DAS 7 - Notify Parent (as implemented, backend v2)

hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white

actor Clock
participant "Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "NotifierService" as Notifier
participant "Repositories\n(Supabase)" as Repo
participant "InsightService" as Insight
participant "EmailProvider\n(Brevo)" as Email

note over Clock, Email
  This flow has no HTTP endpoint. It is driven by an in-process
  timer, and its outcomes are the return values
  parentNotified / notificationFailed - not status codes.
end note

Clock -> Scheduler : tick (every SCHEDULER_TICK_MS)
Scheduler -> Notifier : runDueNotifications(now)
Notifier -> Repo : preferenceRepo.listEnabled()
Repo --> Notifier : NotificationPreference[]

loop for each enabled preference
  Notifier -> Repo : emailNotificationRepo.lastSentAt(parentId)
  Repo --> Notifier : last sent time or null
  Notifier -> Notifier : isDue(lastSentAt, frequency, now)

  alt not due yet
    note right of Notifier : skipped until the\ninterval has elapsed
  else due
    Notifier -> Notifier : notifyParent(parentId, now)
    Notifier -> Repo : parentRepo.byId / studentRepo.listByParent
    Repo --> Notifier : Parent and Student[]

    alt preference disabled, parent missing, or no students
      Notifier --> Scheduler : notificationFailed
    else ready to summarise
      loop for each student
        Notifier -> Insight : getSummary(studentId)

        alt summary available (reused or freshly generated and stored)
          Insight --> Notifier : Summary
        else no progress, or generator unavailable
          Insight --> Notifier : UnavailableError
          note right of Notifier : caught and logged;\nnothing is sent
          Notifier --> Scheduler : notificationFailed
        end
      end

      Notifier -> Email : send(to, subject, body)

      alt email accepted by the provider
        Email ->x] : Email to parent
        Email --> Notifier : sent
        Notifier -> Repo : emailNotificationRepo.insert(...)
        note right of Notifier : the send happens first,\nso a failed send leaves no record
        Repo --> Notifier : recorded
        Notifier --> Scheduler : parentNotified
      else provider unreachable or rejected the send
        Email --> Notifier : EmailSendError
        Notifier --> Scheduler : notificationFailed
      end
    end
  end
end

Scheduler --> Clock : outcomes per parent

@enduml
